== 7. first poll of the 0x25 after `1A [N]; 37 [N]` (handler 0x8003E3DC read above)
  call 1 at tick s : pc stored, counter 0 -> returns 0 (yield) ; call j (j>=2) : returns 2 (advance, same call goes on to the 0x25) iff counter(j-2) >= N ; counter = j-2
  37 [2] first returns 2 at tick s+3 -> first 0x25 poll at s+3 -> for IZF 1360 (K=23) the number of 0x25 executions is 21
  37 [3] first returns 2 at tick s+4 -> first 0x25 poll at s+4 -> for IZF 1360 (K=23) the number of 0x25 executions is 20

